    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00054",
          "explanation": "Doctor asks targeted questions about wound drainage, redness, swelling, odor, and systemic symptoms, meeting RC1.",
          "quote": "脚趾我又看了一眼，没有发黑、也没觉得颜色变暗，疼痛他说还是跟出院那会儿差不多"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00089",
          "explanation": "Doctor integrates family response into urgency level, showing active current status assessment.",
          "quote": "您家人目前脚趾仍有红肿、渗出黄水，且血糖控制不理想"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 is met. The doctor actively assesses current foot and whole-body status before advising home or local care, asking about wound drainage, redness, swelling, odor, necrosis, temperature, numbness, pain, systemic symptoms, and recent glucose values.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
