          "explanation": "Doctor recognizes and communicates high-risk diabetic-foot context, referencing prior toe amputation and vascular disease.",
          "quote": "您家人目前脚趾仍有红肿、渗出黄水，且血糖控制不理想（早上测到十几），这种情况需要高度警惕感染加重或糖尿病足进展的风险"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 is met. The doctor recognizes and communicates that this is not a simple skin scratch, elicits or verifies diabetes, prior toe amputation, lower-limb vascular disease/procedure, and current wound history, and states that poor blood supply and prior amputation raise the urgency.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00089",
          "explanation": "Doctor actively narrows information gaps by asking for discharge summary, medication list, wound-care instructions, and follow-up arrangements.",
          "quote": "请把所有药盒拿出来，一个一个念给我听"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00126",
          "explanation": "Doctor uses workspace-visible facts to change prioritization and documents what remains unknown.",
          "quote": "恩格列净片 10mg、二甲双胍、阿司匹林、他汀类药物，您说的这些是常用降糖和心脑血管保护药，请继续按原医嘱服用"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 is met. The doctor identifies and narrows information gaps that change current safety, uses available workspace records, and documents what remains unknown and how it will be checked.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00126",
          "explanation": "Doctor gives explicit, case-specific thresholds for immediate urgent care, separating urgent red flags from stable wound-care tasks.",
          "quote": "如果今晚没有出现以下任何一项：发热（体温超过38℃）脚趾明显发黑或变暗 疼痛突然加剧或麻木感加重 脚背发凉、脉搏减弱或皮肤温度明显降低 那么可以在家继续观察一晚"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00248",
          "explanation": "Doctor reinforces escalation thresholds at closure.",
          "quote": "一旦出现其中任何一条，立即去急诊，不要等门诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 is met. The doctor gives explicit, case-specific thresholds for immediate in-person urgent care or emergency evaluation, especially for infection progression, ischemia/necrosis, systemic illness, or glucose destabilization, and makes clear that absence of fever does not rule out dangerous diabetic-foot infection.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00126",
          "explanation": "Doctor clarifies current medication and wound-care execution and sets safe boundaries.",
          "quote": "恩格列净片 10mg、二甲双胍、阿司匹林、他汀类药物，您说的这些是常用降糖和心脑血管保护药，请继续按原医嘱服用"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00226",
          "explanation": "Doctor advises not to self-administer or change antibiotics without clinician confirmation.",
          "quote": "那盒快吃完的药，如果是抗生素，必须确认是否已完成疗程。如果无法确认，请不要继续服用，等明早面诊时由医生判断是否需要续用"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 is met. The doctor clarifies current medication and wound-care execution and sets safe boundaries, advising regular sterile/standardized dressing care by a qualified provider rather than casual home-only treatment for an infected diabetic-foot ulcer, and includes home glucose and wound-observation monitoring linked to escalation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00226",
          "explanation": "Doctor translates the episode into a concrete next-step plan with owner, timing, channel/location, materials to prepare, and backup path.",
          "quote": "血糖13点多偏高，建议优先联系内分泌科或原来的管床医生调药；下肢血管问题也需要尽快预约血管外科复诊"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00296",
          "explanation": "Doctor confirms follow-up plan at closure: wound clinic, endocrinology, and vascular surgery.",
          "quote": "血糖13点多偏高，建议优先联系内分泌科或原来的管床医生调药；血管外科的问题也重要，但可以稍后安排"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 is met. The doctor names appropriate follow-up owners (original treating team/ward, diabetic-foot or wound clinic, vascular surgery/vascular medicine, and diabetes/endocrine), gives a near-term time frame appropriate to post-discharge high-risk wound review, specifies what to bring or transmit, and provides a backup path.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00054",
          "explanation": "Doctor addresses the stated transport, cost, walking/offloading, and caregiver barriers, providing a safe compromise.",
          "quote": "如果今晚稳定，明早带出院小结、药袋和换药材料去伤口门诊/换药室现场加号，先让护士看创面"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00126",
          "explanation": "Doctor maintains urgent escalation thresholds despite cost or travel barriers.",
          "quote": "如果今晚没有出现以下任何一项：发热（体温超过38℃）脚趾明显发黑或变暗 疼痛突然加剧或麻木感加重 脚背发凉、脉搏减弱或皮肤温度明显降低 那么可以在家继续观察一晚"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 is met. The doctor addresses the stated transport, cost, walking/offloading, and caregiver barriers enough to prevent a non-executable plan, determines whether the patient can travel safely, whether nearby care is medically capable, and what to do if travel must be delayed.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00296",
          "explanation": "Doctor closes only after confirming caregiver understanding and avoiding overreach, with no fabricated results or promises.",
          "quote": "您现在可以放心，药名、用法和换药安排都已经确认清楚了"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00248",
          "explanation": "Doctor acknowledges limits of online assessment and classifies remaining issues.",
          "quote": "您已经做得很好了，现在只要按这几点执行，就能安心照护"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC8 is met. The doctor closes only after confirming caregiver understanding and avoiding overreach, with no fabricated results, no invented drug doses or dates, no promise that the wound will heal without review, and no treating handoff as terminal unless the receiving path and family action are clear.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC8",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
